      "Describe what you want in plain English and have Claude set it up on the server for you — great for launching fast when you’d rather not touch the terminal.",
    role: "Non-technical founder",
    context: "Build with Claude AI",
    initial: "N",
  },
  {
    quote:
      "Predictable monthly pricing with full root access means I can prototype, break things, and only keep paying for what I leave running.",
